# ── SECRETS & CREDENTIALS (NEVER COMMIT) ──────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keystore
*.jks
*.cer
*.crt
*.pfx
secrets/
credentials/
private/

